      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Subintimal or false lumen deployment is a rare complication of coronary stenting. The authors present a case of false lumen right coronary artery stenting with subsequent closure of the false lumen followed by stenting of the true lumen and compression of the false lumen stent."},
